                the growth of our people and places through E Ola! As we carry
                this kuleana forward through Strategic Plan 2030, Ke Kula
                &#8216;o Kamehameha remains focused on inspiring haumāna,
                cultivating &#8216;āina momona, and uplifting our lāhui — now
                and for generations to come.
              </p>
              <div class="button mb-0">
